---
const legalLinks = [
  'TERMS OF BARANGAY SERVICE',
  'PRIVACY NOTICE (NPC)',
  'ANTI-BOT LAW',
  'KAFRA CODE OF ETHICS',
];
---

<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-t border-surface-container py-space-xl">
  <div
    class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-gutter md:px-gutter-desktop flex flex-col gap-space-lg"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-space-lg">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm">
          <span class="font-headline-md text-title-md text-primary font-bold"
            >Midgarts PH Chronicle</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-badge text-label-badge"
            >REPUBLIC SERVER VER 7107.25</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
          DOTr &amp; DTI Registered. Gravity &amp; Kafra Philippines Corporation © 2002-2025. All
          real-world traffic, weather, and commodity price spikes calibrated for Pinoy gaming
          sanity. Poring drops are subject to Bureau of Customs clearance.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md text-on-surface-variant font-label-data text-label-data">
        {legalLinks.map((link) => <li>{link}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-surface-container pt-space-md">
      <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl">
        <span class="font-label-badge text-label-badge text-tertiary uppercase font-bold mr-1"
          >Satire disclaimer:</span
        >
        Midgarts PH is an artistic parody and an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with,
        endorsed by, or operated by Gravity Co., Ltd., Level Up! Games, any Philippine government
        agency, or any company or artist named on this page. All "patch notes", server statuses,
        prices, and NPC dialogue are humour about shared public experiences, not statements of fact
        or accusations against any person. No hate speech, no defamation, no real Zeny.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
